<section id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph"><span id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">BP-Checkpointing</span>.</h5>

<div id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">BP-Checkpointing</span> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib9" title="" class="ltx_ref">9</a>]</cite> is identical to <span id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">BP-Vanilla</span> with one key difference:
it employs activation checkpointing (also known as gradient checkpointing) to reduce memory consumption, allowing for larger batch sizes without incurring out-of-memory (OOM) errors.
To ensure a fair comparison, the batch sizes used for <span id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">BP-Checkpointing</span> match those used for the ZO and <span id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">FmAD</span> variants.
The hyperparameters are given in Table <a href="#A3.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ BP-Checkpointing. ‣ Appendix C Baselines and Hyperparameters ‣ The Cost of Avoiding Backpropagation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.T5" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption" style="font-size:80%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A3.T5.9" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:113%;">Table 5</span>: </span><span id="A3.T5.10" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:113%;">Hyperparameters related to <span id="A3.T5.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">BP-Checkpointing</span> and <span id="A3.T5.10.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">BP-Accumulate</span> for all datasets.</span></figcaption>
<table id="A3.T5.11" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A3.T5.11.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T5.11.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_border_tt"></td>
<th id="A3.T5.11.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="A3.T5.11.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">AGNews</span></th>
<th id="A3.T5.11.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="A3.T5.11.1.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">BoolQ</span></th>
<th id="A3.T5.11.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="A3.T5.11.1.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">MultiRC</span></th>
