<div id="A6.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Furthermore, Figure <a href="#A6.F4" title="Figure 4 ‣ F.1 Experimental Variance and Loss Curves ‣ Appendix F Additional Results ‣ The Cost of Avoiding Backpropagation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> illustrates the training loss curves with respect to the training time, highlighting the convergence behavior.
We have only showed the best-performing baselines to maintain clarity.</p>
</div>
